{"ID":"20240515131416-ujxykci","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131416-ujxykci","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131416-ujxykci\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140342-2p1wa28\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140342-2p1wa28\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140342-2p1wa28\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:347,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:347\u0026#125;","title":"055","type":"doc","updated":"20240515161640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140342-2p1wa28","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 957px;","id":"20240515140342-2p1wa28","updated":"20240515161640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"45歲，中等身材矮胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/8/21"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後肩痛，後腰痛在帶脈。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙乳有硬塊，兩個月前發現。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"回診持續治療。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥後乳房腫塊略縮小，月經準時來，今天第一天。經來左乳變小，右乳仍大。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠好轉，2：15am不再醒了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便一日一次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足冷，睡時身仍冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無口渴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脈大於左脈。（女子以血為主，正常脈應為左略大於右，目前脈象應是因為月經來潮，經血排出之緣故。）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診\n舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃濕厚。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、HT-2 六兩。 每次40顆，早晚餐飯後服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、同2008/08/14處方，因病人要旅行一週，改為粉劑膠囊。每次10顆，午餐前及睡前服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病患因部分症狀有改善、部分症狀仍持續，故守方再服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因月經至，故加服HT-2退奶丸，並以其為主要處方（劑量較重），利用月經期間奶水下行的自然生理變化時機加強清除奶水的效果。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}